## User Stories

### US-4.1: Create and maintain player records

**As a** league administrator  
**I want to** create and update player records  
**So that** the system maintains player information  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Create a player with all required information and verify that the player is saved.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

### US-4.2: Assign players to teams

**As a** league administrator  
**I want to** assign a player to a team  
**So that** team rosters reflect player membership  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Assign a player to an existing team and verify that the player appears on its roster.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

### US-4.3: View team rosters

**As a** data user  
**I want to** view a team's roster  
**So that** I can see which players belong to that team  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Open a team's roster and verify that its assigned players are displayed.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

